    <name>HAZARD Big Sur - no cell signal, no bike shop, no exit</name>
    <desc>From Carmel to Cambria there is no bike shop, no hospital, no transit and long stretches with no cell signal. A destroyed rear wheel here is a hitch-hike, not a phone call. Carry: 2 tubes, patches, a boot, a spare quick-link, a derailleur hanger, and enough water for 60 km.  [day1_sf_limekiln km 304, 784 m off route]</desc>
