    <desc>US-101 through Gaviota Pass. Bicycles are allowed through the Gaviota Tunnel - it is the only route between the South Coast and the Santa Ynez Valley. Southbound you are descending; take the lane through the bore and run lights. Position approximate.  [day2_limekiln_refugio km 280, 644 m off route]</desc>
