    <name>Refugio SB - NIGHT 2 (hike/bike)</name>
    <desc>THE NIGHT 2 TARGET. 10 Refugio Beach Road, Goleta CA 93117 - 20 miles west of Santa Barbara, off US-101 at Refugio Road. Hike-and-bike campsites confirmed; drinking water, restrooms, showers, outdoor showers, and a camp store on site. Open August 2026. Park/district phone (805) 968-1033. VERIFY the per-person hike/bike rate: the $10/person figure in the plan is NOT published on the park page - phone it. SRC parks.ca.gov/refugio  [day2_limekiln_refugio km 303]</desc>
    <sym>Campground</sym>
    <type>camp</type>
  </wpt>
