    <name>El Capitan SB - NIGHT 2 alt (3 km later)</name>
    <desc>Third of the three Gaviota-coast hike/bike parks, 2.6 km east of Refugio, and the one with the most services. Reported first-come, first-served on the middle/upper loops through 28 Jun 2026 - VERIFY current status and whether that extends to August.  [day2_limekiln_refugio km 303, 2250 m off route]</desc>
